{
  "summary": "Analysis of Cromite filter identity mapping. The configuration defines canonical identities hosted at uazo.github.io. The inventory provides evidence for mapping these to raw.githubusercontent.com/uazo/cromite/pages/. Most identities in GetKnownSubscriptions() have corresponding entries in the inventory. 'easyprivacy.txt' is explicitly unmapped. The experimental filter list (raw.githubusercontent.com/uazo/cromite/master/...) is correctly identified as having no pages-list fallback. I propose a static helper to perform this bounded mapping.",
  "architecture_observations": [
    "Canonical host: https://uazo.github.io/cromite/filters/",
    "Fallback host: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uazo/cromite/pages/",
    "Mapping is strictly filename-based; no arbitrary prefixing allowed.",
    "Experimental identity (master branch) must remain distinct from pages-list.",
    "Existing 'MaybeSplitCombinedAdblockList' is host-specific to ABP domains and should not be used for Cromite mapping."
  ],
  "proposed_changes": [
    {
      "file": "components/adblock/core/subscription/subscription_config.h",
      "change": "Add declaration for 'GURL GetCromiteFallbackUrl(const GURL& canonical_url);'."
    },
    {
      "file": "components/adblock/core/subscription/subscription_config.cc",
      "change": "Implement 'GetCromiteFallbackUrl' using strict filename extraction and host replacement."
    }
  ],
  "patch": "--- a/components/adblock/core/subscription/subscription_config.h
+++ b/components/adblock/core/subscription/subscription_config.h
@@ -105,6 +105,9 @@
     const std::vector<std::string_view>& MaybeSplitCombinedAdblockList(
         const GURL& filter_list);

+// Returns the raw.githubusercontent.com/uazo/cromite/pages/ fallback for a
+// canonical uazo.github.io/cromite/filters/ URL. Returns empty GURL if invalid.
+GURL GetCromiteFallbackUrl(const GURL& canonical_url);
 }

 }  // namespace adblock

--- a/components/adblock/core/subscription/subscription_config.cc
+++ b/components/adblock/core/subscription/subscription_config.cc
@@ -315,4 +315,21 @@
   return *EMPTY_VALUE;
 }

+GURL GetCromiteFallbackUrl(const GURL& canonical_url) {
+  static const GURL kCanonicalHost("https://uazo.github.io/cromite/filters/");
+  static const GURL kFallbackHost("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uazo/cromite/pages/");
+  
+  if (!canonical_url.scheme().empty() && 
+      canonical_url.host() == kCanonicalHost.host() &&
+      canonical_url.path().starts_with("/filters/")) {
+    
+    std::string filename = base::TrimString(canonical_url.path(), "/", base::TRIM_LEADING);
+    filename = filename.substr(filename.find_last_of('/') + 1);
+    
+    return GURL(kFallbackHost.spec() + filename);
+  }
+  return GURL();
+}
+
 }  // namespace adblock",
  "risks": [
    "Incorrect path parsing could lead to mapping non-filter files.",
    "Strict host checking is required to prevent accidental mapping of experimental/master URLs."
  ],
  "tests": [
    "Test mapping: https://uazo.github.io/cromite/filters/easylist.txt -> https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uazo/cromite/pages/easylist.txt",
    "Test non-mapping: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uazo/cromite/master/... -> empty GURL",
    "Test invalid host: https://example.com/filters/test.txt -> empty GURL"
  ]
}

